WEBVTT

00:51.200 --> 00:55.330
Self-frenzied: 300%!

01:10.970 --> 01:13.220
This is the only one we have.

01:13.510 --> 01:18.020
If I can't regain myself,
I will leave the aftermath to you.

01:18.890 --> 01:20.390
Dragon Arm Release.

01:52.180 --> 01:55.010
I don't need any future beyond this.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.930
I will fly!

03:25.730 --> 03:30.190
RAGNA CRIMSON

03:33.530 --> 03:35.950
CHAPTER 22: THE WINGED MONARCH

03:35.950 --> 03:37.530
CHAPTER 22: THE WINGED MONARCH
Fu!

03:37.530 --> 03:38.970
CHAPTER 22: THE WINGED MONARCH

04:33.000 --> 04:35.300
Fu! Hey! Open your eyes!

04:35.920 --> 04:38.010
Open your eyes
and heal your wounds!

04:38.010 --> 04:40.550
If you need your lower body,
I will search for one nearby!

04:40.550 --> 04:43.930
At least stop your bleeding, Fu!

04:43.930 --> 04:49.520
My body isn't that convenient, idiot...

04:50.370 --> 04:55.730
But... Good thing you didn't let me fall...

04:56.050 --> 05:00.360
Just stop that thing's movement for a bit...

05:01.820 --> 05:05.060
I will use up all the magic
that I took from him...

05:05.700 --> 05:08.250
...and I'll let him taste
some good shit.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.620
I'm on it.

05:10.920 --> 05:12.250
Christopher!

05:12.250 --> 05:14.630
You'd better support Fu, Major.

05:15.260 --> 05:16.750
How many seconds do you need?

05:16.750 --> 05:18.260
20 seconds.

05:18.260 --> 05:21.630
Roger that. Don't miss it!

05:21.970 --> 05:24.390
Gramp, you're really strong.

05:24.930 --> 05:27.810
Young Shin sure has a lot of talent too.

05:28.520 --> 05:31.890
Now, my time has come
as a fellow Chief Swordsman.

05:31.890 --> 05:34.560
Come at me!

05:34.560 --> 05:36.900
- Eat this!
- Christopher.

05:36.900 --> 05:41.240
You have precious blood
flowing in you.

05:41.240 --> 05:44.280
You must learn
the perfect etiquette

05:44.280 --> 05:46.830
for when royal palace members
come for you.

05:48.040 --> 05:52.240
My mother was a former maid
who worked at the royal palace.

05:52.240 --> 05:55.000
She was a mistress of the king,
and gave birth to me.

05:55.770 --> 05:58.500
It may be just the imagination
of a crazy woman,

05:58.500 --> 06:00.880
but she believes it vehemently.

06:00.880 --> 06:03.220
I was brought up that way.

06:03.800 --> 06:05.720
Yes, Mother.

06:05.720 --> 06:08.720
You shouldn't speak to such
lowly peasant boys!

06:08.720 --> 06:12.230
You don't have to think
about getting money!

06:12.230 --> 06:14.600
If you have time for that, go study!

06:14.600 --> 06:16.610
Why can't you remember
such a simple thing?!

06:16.610 --> 06:19.230
You shouldn't have been born!

06:19.230 --> 06:20.230
Until the very end...

06:22.030 --> 06:26.950
You must keep the elegance
befitting of a royal at all times.

06:27.780 --> 06:30.410
I love you, Chris.

06:30.410 --> 06:34.620
So, please answer my expectations.

06:35.040 --> 06:37.470
Ah, forgive me, Chris.

06:38.000 --> 06:40.960
You are my treasure.

06:40.960 --> 06:46.630
As long as you are here, one day,
I can get my happiness...

06:47.550 --> 06:50.900
You are my hope.

06:52.810 --> 06:56.440
After my mother's passing,
I turned into a mercenary.

06:56.440 --> 06:58.770
I did anything for money.

06:59.320 --> 07:03.240
Rather, most of what I did were crimes.

07:03.780 --> 07:07.450
But no matter what I did
or wherever I went...

07:08.280 --> 07:11.870
My heart had never been freed.

07:16.040 --> 07:19.630
You hold out alone fighting
a mature dragon, huh?

07:19.920 --> 07:21.140
Silverware Princess!

07:21.920 --> 07:23.470
Just as the rumor said!

07:23.470 --> 07:24.800
She has no hands!

07:24.800 --> 07:26.800
She's flying and shining!

07:27.340 --> 07:30.010
You're quite something.
I'll give you that.

07:30.010 --> 07:32.640
Everything about her is abnormal.

07:32.640 --> 07:35.230
And yet, so perfect.

07:35.230 --> 07:37.980
No need for an introduction, right?

07:37.980 --> 07:40.480
It is I, the only one in the world.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.730
This is the real thing!

07:42.730 --> 07:47.280
In the ideal world,
you are supposed to be a king!

07:47.280 --> 07:49.450
That's full of crap.

07:56.660 --> 07:59.270
My name is Christopher Algren.

07:59.770 --> 08:03.420
I am deeply grateful to you
for saving my life,

08:03.420 --> 08:05.260
Your Highness Starlia Lese!

08:05.260 --> 08:07.430
Garnessian style, huh?

08:07.430 --> 08:10.090
Despite losing one arm,
you're something else.

08:10.090 --> 08:12.010
Did you come from a good place?

08:12.890 --> 08:14.100
You're kidding me.

08:14.100 --> 08:15.140
I met her.

08:15.140 --> 08:18.480
And just by that,
my heart was freed.

08:18.480 --> 08:20.520
I'm just a mercenary.

08:21.940 --> 08:25.330
Hey, Princess, would you hire me?

08:35.659 --> 08:36.870
This is...

08:37.830 --> 08:40.039
Where I give the most of my life!

09:07.690 --> 09:10.450
I know I am not special.

09:11.330 --> 09:13.620
But every member of the corps...

09:16.470 --> 09:19.250
...has an episode with the commander!

09:19.250 --> 09:21.250
That's why all of us...

09:21.250 --> 09:22.460
...are strong!

09:24.500 --> 09:25.750
In the past...

09:26.420 --> 09:30.220
I made drugs and spread it
around the kingdom...

09:30.220 --> 09:32.640
I was caught by the commander

09:32.640 --> 09:35.350
and then stuck being
worked to the butt by her.

09:36.680 --> 09:39.560
This is my last moment,
I'll reveal that.

09:40.140 --> 09:41.190
As for me...

09:41.770 --> 09:44.020
Thanks to that criminal
not being apprehended,

09:44.480 --> 09:46.270
I got thrown into the corps.

09:47.070 --> 09:48.230
Well...

09:48.900 --> 09:50.530
Great coincidence.

09:51.700 --> 09:52.930
Yeah.

09:55.490 --> 09:56.960
You're right.

10:02.540 --> 10:04.250
Hey, you guys.

10:04.250 --> 10:07.950
We were an awesome squad, right?

10:26.940 --> 10:31.030
What is that... monster?

10:34.110 --> 10:37.320
Oh... That's me.

10:49.960 --> 10:54.300
I used my trump card
to take them down with me...

10:54.300 --> 10:56.160
...yet this is how I end up.

11:00.890 --> 11:04.480
You guys did really well.

11:04.480 --> 11:08.400
I genuinely think so.

11:09.770 --> 11:13.110
I want to gift you...

11:13.110 --> 11:16.320
...something more,
not only my life.

11:19.580 --> 11:21.740
What a terrible end.

11:21.740 --> 11:27.710
What awaits us beyond this fight
is just a tragic ending.

11:28.000 --> 11:31.710
But I have no regrets.

11:32.250 --> 11:34.800
I have no regret in meeting you,
Lady Lakucia,

11:34.800 --> 11:39.430
and in spending my days
with my brother in arms.

11:39.850 --> 11:41.610
Not a single regret.

12:09.920 --> 12:10.900
And Your Highness?

12:11.430 --> 12:12.670
She was gone before us.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.710
I see...

12:16.800 --> 12:17.930
Let's go.

12:18.400 --> 12:19.770
We have something to finish.

12:36.360 --> 12:39.090
She switches to the most
troublesome fighting style.

12:39.530 --> 12:42.280
Ultimatia is the weakest
among the Dragon Monarch,

12:42.280 --> 12:44.030
but she has the most
magic among them.

12:44.790 --> 12:47.410
Just by shooting her magic randomly,

12:47.410 --> 12:49.670
she's stronger than
most superior dragons.

12:50.500 --> 12:53.460
I can't get closer.
So then...

12:53.460 --> 12:55.460
I'll attack her mentally.

12:56.130 --> 12:57.510
Erase Noise.

12:58.830 --> 13:00.340
Maximum Volume.

13:00.940 --> 13:02.890
What a terrifying spectacle.

13:02.890 --> 13:05.110
As if you're entirely different
from Carula.

13:06.220 --> 13:09.820
Did you want to have a self so bad
that you turned into a monster?

13:10.640 --> 13:13.610
Hey, Product Number 19835.

13:14.980 --> 13:17.440
What kind of form
does your God appear in?

13:18.490 --> 13:20.320
There is no true form.

13:20.320 --> 13:24.740
It takes the most hard-to-ignore form
depending on the one who sees it.

13:25.910 --> 13:29.690
The one who said to destroy a kingdom
because a cake shop got ruined,

13:29.690 --> 13:31.300
was your God, right?

13:32.370 --> 13:34.040
Sounds like a kid's tantrum.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.670
Right, it's a kid.

13:37.130 --> 13:38.810
The God that you see...

13:38.810 --> 13:39.880
...is a girl.

13:40.550 --> 13:43.340
A girl with the same face as you.

13:43.340 --> 13:47.560
The many sisters who died
because of you.

13:47.890 --> 13:48.810
Am I right?

13:52.020 --> 13:53.830
I wanted to remain kind.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.770
Not because that's how Carula is,

13:56.770 --> 13:58.790
but by my own will,

13:59.400 --> 14:01.930
I didn't want to choose who to save.

14:02.450 --> 14:06.200
But the one that I want
to save the most...

14:06.200 --> 14:08.240
...was myself.

14:08.240 --> 14:12.210
AGE OF THE SUN, YEAR 446,
GEHENNA HOLE: THE ABYSS OF HELL

14:12.210 --> 14:14.920
THE SOLARIAN CHURCH, 17TH FRONTLINE BASE

14:19.130 --> 14:20.460
It hurts!

14:21.940 --> 14:23.260
Lord...

14:23.810 --> 14:24.820
It's dark...

14:25.510 --> 14:26.560
I can't see...

14:27.390 --> 14:28.510
Mum...

14:29.470 --> 14:31.230
Don't worry.

14:31.230 --> 14:33.480
1 YEAR 2 MONTHS AFTER BIRTH
I will heal your wound.

14:33.480 --> 14:35.650
1 YEAR 2 MONTHS AFTER BIRTH
Just leave it to me.

14:38.070 --> 14:40.480
Starting bandaged wound healing.

14:41.070 --> 14:42.930
But this one method wouldn't save him.

14:44.070 --> 14:47.450
Time control magic.
Hasten the speed of healing!

14:50.160 --> 14:58.960
Myself number 18302, 374,
448, 460, and 19835.

14:58.960 --> 15:01.190
Come to the special
treatment room immediately.

15:08.640 --> 15:11.430
I need you to help me heal this person.

15:11.720 --> 15:13.680
But it appears he has already died.

15:14.140 --> 15:15.640
No problem.

15:15.640 --> 15:18.870
I stopped the time at
five minutes after death.

15:18.870 --> 15:20.900
Time reversion is still possible to do.

15:20.900 --> 15:26.530
Excuse me, the one I'm tending to
is also in critical condition...

15:26.530 --> 15:30.120
The person you're healing
is a Fourth-Class Lamb.

15:30.410 --> 15:32.870
But this person is a Second-Class Lamb.

15:32.870 --> 15:35.830
He is important to support this war.

15:40.460 --> 15:43.460
I am sorry for being late.

15:44.670 --> 15:45.990
Is this...

15:48.340 --> 15:50.600
...what they call a family?

15:51.470 --> 15:56.060
So someone will be saddened
by this person's passing.

15:56.060 --> 15:57.430
How cruel...

15:58.060 --> 16:00.940
Thank you for your work back then.

16:00.940 --> 16:02.070
Lady Carula.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.250
You are also Carula, right?

16:04.690 --> 16:07.820
But... you seem a bit young.

16:07.820 --> 16:09.200
Yes.

16:09.200 --> 16:12.280
Since there was not enough me
on the front line,

16:12.280 --> 16:15.330
my growth period was shortened
and I got assigned.

16:15.330 --> 16:17.500
Oh, is that so?

16:17.500 --> 16:20.420
Now is quite a terrible situation.

16:20.420 --> 16:24.340
Don't worry, you will get used to it soon.
Because you're me.

16:26.300 --> 16:28.970
Excuse me, your body...!

16:31.090 --> 16:37.270
Oh, the last one was my limit...

16:37.270 --> 16:38.460
So it seems...

16:44.270 --> 16:47.030
I'm sending this to all of my selves.

16:47.030 --> 16:49.700
I've reached my usage limit.

16:50.320 --> 16:55.410
I'll have my Number 18819 self
to take my position.

16:56.120 --> 17:01.880
I will now die, so goodbye, Young Me.

17:02.630 --> 17:05.839
Oh my, why do you make
that expression?

17:07.050 --> 17:10.300
You're really a strange me.

17:11.230 --> 17:14.760
This is the very front line
of human's battle against dragons.

17:15.150 --> 17:17.510
The place where human lives
are worth the least.

17:18.089 --> 17:19.099
Lady Carula!

17:19.849 --> 17:23.609
Thanks to you, my life was saved!

17:25.270 --> 17:29.700
Now, I can fight the dragons
for the sake of Our Lord again!

17:29.700 --> 17:30.610
Thank you!

17:31.610 --> 17:35.620
But my self who saved you
had died, though...

17:36.120 --> 17:41.540
God always gives his blessing
to those who serve his purpose.

17:41.540 --> 17:45.630
It is my pleasure to support
those endeavors.

17:52.680 --> 17:54.510
He's so bothersome.

17:54.510 --> 17:58.720
I thought I died!
I thought that was the end of me!

17:59.180 --> 18:00.230
Huh?

18:09.860 --> 18:11.070
Nebulim?!

18:11.320 --> 18:14.610
Here it comes!

18:21.790 --> 18:24.250
Sunlight Weapon!

18:24.250 --> 18:25.670
Unleashed!

18:28.380 --> 18:30.550
Okay, shoot away!

18:37.640 --> 18:40.140
Finally, we get enough shadow.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.850
Get swallowed by your own shadow.

18:42.850 --> 18:45.850
Our boss said it to us!

18:45.850 --> 18:48.860
With both of us, you're not a threat!

18:49.820 --> 18:52.990
Die while still being useless!

18:56.410 --> 18:57.200
Elder.

18:59.620 --> 19:02.410
Nebu... lim?

19:03.040 --> 19:06.080
It's too late, but I understand now.

19:06.830 --> 19:11.710
The Spatial Magic is a magic that is close
to God under restricted conditions.

19:12.260 --> 19:13.720
This is just a guess...

19:13.720 --> 19:18.020
But I think the Former Winged Monarch
wanted to be a God himself.

19:19.300 --> 19:21.720
I thought that even I might
be able to do it too.

19:22.970 --> 19:24.940
But it's too late for me.

19:25.980 --> 19:27.900
So I will leave it to you, Elder.

19:29.730 --> 19:32.360
I'm sorry I can't meet your expectations.

19:32.610 --> 19:34.280
What are you saying?!

19:34.280 --> 19:37.200
You have always exceeded
my expectations!

19:37.200 --> 19:39.570
I'm sorry that I'm useless.

19:39.570 --> 19:41.330
You can do it now!

19:41.330 --> 19:44.620
You can be the center of the Bloodline now
and protect the progenitor!

19:45.370 --> 19:46.880
In my place,

19:48.070 --> 19:50.710
please protect Lady Ultimatia.

19:50.710 --> 19:55.590
Don't die, Nebulim!

19:59.300 --> 20:03.310
Yeah! What a huge campfire!

20:03.310 --> 20:05.230
You weaklings! Weaklings!

20:09.190 --> 20:11.860
Eh? Why did it turn night again?

20:29.580 --> 20:33.380
Wait, nobody warns me of this...

21:27.350 --> 21:31.390
I'm the highest leader
of the Solarian Church,

21:31.390 --> 21:33.270
Carula the Saint of Time.

21:33.270 --> 21:35.110
I know already.

21:35.800 --> 21:39.070
To protect the progenitor is
of the utmost importance.

21:40.570 --> 21:43.310
The human with the highest worth.

21:44.320 --> 21:48.830
Please, just within this moment,
let me mourn you.

21:48.830 --> 21:51.210
But when I die,

21:51.830 --> 21:54.670
who will be mourning me?

21:59.050 --> 22:00.300
How frail.

22:00.300 --> 22:02.010
Disappear, you replacement goods.

22:06.470 --> 22:07.750
What?!
